points against wizard and lich summoned monsters, but the wizard grabbed 
the amulet and hid on the next level so I had time to Eye regenerate my 
spell points and make a few offerings.

Air was the toughest of the elemental plains until I charmed all of the 
Air Elementals.

At Astral I went right hit Death and a lawful altar then came back to 
the center for Pestilence and chaos.  The side trip right had a bad 
moment when I turned into a Yellow dragon due to polymorph self while 
wearing conflict and +4 damage, but I had the Eye and used the breath to 
clear things out a bit.

I think I see a way to get a lot of conduct medals next time so I'll try 
